    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3824" root="ترب" body-key="t">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَارَبَتْهَا</span></b>  <i>She became her</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِرْب</span>; (M, K;) [i. e.]
<i>she</i> (a girl) <i>matched her,</i> namely, another girl;
<i>she was,</i> or <i>became, her match, fellow,</i> or <i>equal;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاذَتْهَا</span>. (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [The inf. n.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَارَبَةٌ</span> also
signifies The <i>associating,</i> or <i>consorting, of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتْرَابٌ</span>
[pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِرْبٌ</span>, q. v.]. (K.)

